EXPORTS TOOL   cmake
EXPORTS FOLDER cmake-data /usr/share/cmake-4.4
FILE /usr/share/licenses/cmake/LICENSE.rst
FILE /usr/share/licenses/libuv/LICENSE
FILE /usr/share/man/cat1/cmake.1
    cmake: CMake bootstrapped from upstream's source inside Dolly, with the cc
    package it configures and builds with.
    
      cmake -S . -B build           configures, for Unix Makefiles
      cmake --build build           builds through make
      cmake --help                  every option
    
    The platform is Dolly's (Platform/Dolly.cmake): CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME is Dolly.
    Upstream's documentation: https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/
